# ── Data files (large raw data — regenerate from nflfastR) ───────────────────
# Processed training table can be large; exclude if over GitHub's 100MB limit.
# Uncomment the line below if needed:
# nfl-prediction/data/processed/game_training_table.csv

# NOTE: predictions.json IS committed — it's the static data artifact
# that Vercel serves. Do not add it here.
.vercel
.env*
